  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">암석관찰과 내용을 배운다음에<br>각자 자신과 닮았다고 생각되는 암석을 1가지씩 선택하여,<br>설명해보는 수업을 진행해봤습니다.<br><br>암석의 특징, 외모 관찰결과, 생성과정, 용도 등과<br>자신의  성격, 외모, 가치관, 미래목표 등을 매칭시켜 설명하고,<br>특징을 잘 나타내는 캐릭터까지 그려봤습니다.<br><br>첨엔 돌과 자신을 연결짓는 것을  생소하게 여겼으나,<br>곧잘 재밌게 해냈습니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c93e276509a76abd09ebd89ed50a151f95a9bdd7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c93e276509a76abd09ebd89ed50a151f95a9bdd7\" data-origin-width=\"3148\" data-origin-height=\"1744\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b63e25ea1c5a7ddcef002c1298104a1850d10060\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b63e25ea1c5a7ddcef002c1298104a1850d10060\" data-origin-width=\"2915\" data-origin-height=\"1805\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/36a7a7f03428ff791cf10dc4e2747ce64e774847\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/36a7a7f03428ff791cf10dc4e2747ce64e774847\" data-origin-width=\"2921\" data-origin-height=\"1759\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a81059f28684740356ac5b7bdf945304f4f4107\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a81059f28684740356ac5b7bdf945304f4f4107\" data-origin-width=\"2957\" data-origin-height=\"1760\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA